{!Contact.FirstName},<br /><br />

Thank you for your application to the <a href=https://schoolofsustainability.asu.edu/graduate/master-of-sustainability.php>MSUS program</a> in the School of Sustainability at Arizona State University for the fall 2015 semester. <br /><br />

You should have received an automated email from ASU Graduate Admissions with instructions on setting up your <a href=https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/>My ASU account</a>. In My ASU, you can monitor the status of the following items: <br /><br />

<ul>
<li>Your <a href=https://students.asu.edu/graduate/apply#mailing>official transcripts</a><br />
<li><a href=https://students.asu.edu/graduate/proficiency>English Proficiency</a> requirements (if applicable)<br />
<li>Your letters of recommendation</li></ul><br />

The "Manage Recommenders" feature allows you to view details on which letters are still missing. You can send an email reminder (once every seven days) to your recommenders.<br /><br />

We must have all materials by <b>Dec. 15, 2014</b> to consider your application <b>including GRE scores</b> (if applicable). We will send you an email once your application file is complete. Then we will notify your of our decision in early February.<br /><br />

Please contact the Sustainability advising office at 480-727-6963 or <a href=mailto:SOSGradAdvising@asu.edu?Subject=MSUS%20Application%20Question%20for%20Advising="_top">SOSGradAdvising@asu.edu</a> if you have any questions. <br /><br />

Regards,<br /><br />

<b>Katerina Kinast<br />
Graduate Academic Success Coordinator</b><br />
P.O. Box 875502 | Tempe, Arizona | 85287-5502<br />
PH: 480-965-5923 | Main: 480-727-6963

